      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Rollback version differs between boards.\n\nAh, yes. I was thinking that we would always update all boards at the same time. I guess that we don\u0027t have to update the boards that we haven\u0027t shipped yet. Would there be any harm in keeping rollback the same across all boards, even if it\u0027s not strictly needed?",
