      "writtenOn": "2026-02-19T17:28:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Would there be any harm in keeping rollback the same across all boards, even if it\u0027s not strictly needed?\n\nNo, I don\u0027t think so. The only thing that comes to my mind are bugs in algorithm. We would need to bump rollback value for all boards if there\u0027s a bug in one implementation.",
      "parentUuid": "f5523963_33c17cb5",
      "revId": "3e45018d6e12a9ae06d699605514791266ebd5ab",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
