      "writtenOn": "2026-02-19T17:36:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, it\u0027s not strictly needed in cases like that. As long as it doesn\u0027t cause any problems, then it might be easier to keep track of a single rollback value. From a firmware management standpoint, it might start to get complicated to keep all of the variations in our head. I don\u0027t feel too strongly though, so it\u0027s up to you.",
